  // COMMANDS  [ ▌ ]                                                                                          
                                                                                                              
    LOOK                                                                                                      
    ▸ Overview                                     mcpcardano status                                          
    ◆ Wallets, their limits and what they spent    mcpcardano policy show -wallet <id>                        
    ◆ Approvals waiting                            mcpcardano status                                          
    ◆ Security keys                                mcpcardano key list                                        
    REDUCE RISK                                                                                               
    ◆ Freeze every wallet                          mcpcardano freeze                                          
    ◆ Freeze the chosen wallet                     mcpcardano freeze -wallet <id>                             
    ◆ Close the chosen wallet's session            mcpcardano session close -wallet <id>                      
    AUTHORIZE                                                                                                 
    ◆ Unfreeze the chosen wallet                   mcpcardano unfreeze -wallet <id>                           
    ◆ Open a session on the chosen wallet          mcpcardano session open -wallet <id> -for 1h -max <lovelac…
    ◆ Edit the chosen wallet's policy              mcpcardano policy set -wallet <id> <policy.json>           
    ◆ Edit the template of the agent's wallets     mcpcardano policy set -template <policy.json>              
    ◆ Release the chosen wallet's budget           mcpcardano budget release -wallet <id>                     
    ◆ See the chosen wallet's recovery phrase      mcpcardano wallet backup -wallet <id>                      
    ◆ Create a wallet                              mcpcardano wallet create -label <name>                     
    ◆ Restore a wallet                             mcpcardano wallet restore -label <name>                    
    VIEW                                                                                                      
    ◆ Help                                                                                                    
    ◆ Quit                                                                                                    
                                                                                                              
                                                                                                              
                                                                                                              
